    "adds one guarded source line to each existing ~/.bashrc and ~/.zshrc; if neither exists, creates ~/.zshrc when $SHELL is zsh, otherwise ~/.bashrc": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "fügt jeder vorhandenen ~/.bashrc und ~/.zshrc eine abgesicherte source-Zeile hinzu; existiert keine davon, wird ~/.zshrc angelegt, wenn $SHELL zsh ist, sonst ~/.bashrc"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "añade una línea source protegida a cada ~/.bashrc y ~/.zshrc existente; si no existe ninguna, crea ~/.zshrc cuando $SHELL es zsh y, si no, ~/.bashrc"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ajoute une ligne source protégée à chaque ~/.bashrc et ~/.zshrc existant ; si aucun n'existe, crée ~/.zshrc quand $SHELL vaut zsh, sinon ~/.bashrc"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "既存の ~/.bashrc と ~/.zshrc それぞれにガード付きの source 行を 1 行追加します。どちらも無い場合、$SHELL が zsh なら ~/.zshrc を、そうでなければ ~/.bashrc を作成します"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为每个已存在的 ~/.bashrc 和 ~/.zshrc 各添加一行带保护的 source 语句；若两者都不存在，则在 $SHELL 为 zsh 时创建 ~/.zshrc，否则创建 ~/.bashrc"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "為每個已存在的 ~/.bashrc 和 ~/.zshrc 各新增一行附保護的 source 敘述；若兩者都不存在，則在 $SHELL 為 zsh 時建立 ~/.zshrc，否則建立 ~/.bashrc"
          }
        }
      }
    },
