    "the terminal owns them — that's why app shortcuts must include ⌘": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Terminal beansprucht sie — deshalb müssen App-Kurzbefehle ⌘ enthalten"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "las reclama el terminal — por eso los atajos de la app deben incluir ⌘"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "le terminal se les approprie — c'est pourquoi les raccourcis de l'app doivent inclure ⌘"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ターミナルが受け取ります — だからアプリのショートカットには ⌘ が必要です"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们归终端所有 —— 所以应用快捷键必须带 ⌘"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它們歸終端機所有 —— 所以 App 快捷鍵必須帶 ⌘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the terminal's text input claims the arrow keys first. try a letter or a punctuation key.": {
